# The serving artifacts are identified by their md5 (DVC pointers, model_version).
# Git must store them byte-for-byte: no line-ending conversion on any platform.
# Without this, core.autocrlf turned the JSON artifacts' CRLF into LF on commit,
# so every Linux checkout (CI, Docker, a clean machine) got different md5s.
models/*.joblib -text
models/*.json -text
tests/fixtures/** -text
